<p>WW Wood Products is the factory behind the four public WW Wood lines on this site. Pinnacle Sales is the exclusive WW Wood dealer representative across Arizona, California, Colorado, Idaho, Montana, Nevada, New Mexico, Oregon, Utah, and Washington. The dealer is the customer. This page is not a consumer storefront.</p>

<h2>WW Wood first</h2>
<p>Family-owned WW Wood Products has manufactured in Dudley, Missouri since 1977. <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh</a> is the usual first line: face-frame and inset, paint program, all-plywood box. <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse</a> is frameless from the same factory, same door styles and finishes. <a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect</a> is the value line. <a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora</a> is the made-to-order closet system. All four are built in Dudley.</p>

<h2>Lead times already on this site</h2>
<p>Shiloh, Eclipse, and Aspect typically ship in approximately 6 weeks. Vistora ships in 5-6 weeks. Those are the numbers we already publish. Ask your rep on the intro call for the current production picture. Do not treat this page as a live queue.</p>

<h2>Factory access, not a public tour desk</h2>
<p>Dealer support already includes factory tours. Pinnacle Sales does not list upcoming trip dates, headcounts, or unpublished leads on this site. Apply. Your territory rep schedules factory access when it fits the market conversation. A published dealer story from a prior visit lives in the <a href="/playbook/greenwood-kitchens-factory-visit/">Playbook</a>. That is existing content, not a new calendar.</p>

<h2>Territory and apply</h2>
<p>WW Wood on this site is a 10-state Western map. We do not publish a dealer locator. Check Shiloh on the <a href="/become-a-dealer/">application</a>, or any of the six public brands. You do not have to take all six. Custom shops and dealers leaving a box line: start at <a href="/guides/become-a-shiloh-dealer/">become a Shiloh dealer</a>. Territory map: <a href="/guides/protected-dealer-territories/">protected dealer territories</a>.</p>

<h2>Pronorm is not Dudley</h2>
<p><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm</a> is a German fitted line available nationwide through European Kitchen Distributors (EKD), a Pinnacle Sales company. It is a short aside here. If you want the WW Wood factory story, open Shiloh first.</p>

</AeoGuide>
